# Who must approve changes to the shared AI layer and to sensitive code.
# Takes effect when branch protection has "Require review from Code Owners" turned on.
# Replace the placeholder teams with your own GitHub teams.

# Default: any maintainer
*                                   @your-org/maintainers

# The AI rules every tool follows
AGENTS.md                           @your-org/platform-leads
**/AGENTS.md                        @your-org/platform-leads
CLAUDE.md                           @your-org/platform-leads
/.github/copilot-instructions.md    @your-org/platform-leads

# What AI tools may connect to, and the checks that enforce it
/ai/                                @your-org/security
/.mcp.json                          @your-org/security
/.cursor/                           @your-org/security
/.vscode/mcp.json                   @your-org/security
/.claude/                           @your-org/security
/tools/                             @your-org/security
/.githooks/                         @your-org/security
/.github/workflows/                 @your-org/security
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @your-org/security
/.pre-commit-config.yaml            @your-org/security

# Build tooling that downloads and runs binaries
/services/orders/mvnw               @your-org/security
/services/orders/mvnw.cmd           @your-org/security
/services/orders/.mvn/              @your-org/security

# Sensitive code: payments owners review every change, whoever or whatever wrote it
/services/payments/                 @your-org/payments-owners
